1 REM FBCS PRG-0191
2 REM CLAIM A-4.2.2-TR157
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 4.2.2 l.1317-1320 and 10.1.4 l.4990-5052: RESTORE n reaches the DATA of its own unit when three units repeat the numbers.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB E, F
20 DATA 1, 2
30 DATA 3
40 RESTORE 30
50 READ A
60 CALL E
70 CALL F
80 RESTORE
85 READ B
90 PRINT "M"; A; B
100 END
6 EXTERNAL SUB E
20 DATA 10, 20
30 DATA 30
40 RESTORE 30
50 READ A
60 RESTORE 20
70 READ B
90 PRINT "E"; A; B
100 END SUB
7 EXTERNAL SUB F
20 DATA 100
30 DATA 300
50 READ A, B
90 PRINT "F"; A; B
100 END SUB
